# Revenue by Region

Inline CSV — the simplest way to get a chart on the page.

```chart type=bar x=region y=sales title="Revenue by region (Q1)"
region, sales
North, 120
South, 95
East, 70
West, 140
```

The same chart block, without a title:

```chart type=bar x=region y=sales
region, sales
North, 120
South, 95
East, 70
West, 140
```
